      },
      {
        "id": "E4",
        "kind": "body",
        "text": "Earlier this month, we released Mistral Large 4 (Le Chonk), our flagship 1-trillion-parameter, natively multimodal model, in public preview.",
        "sourceUrl": "https://mistral.ai/news/mistral-large-4-oss/",
        "source": "Mistral AI",
        "publishedAt": "2026-10-29T12:00:07.000Z",
