        "publishedAt": "2026-10-29T12:00:07.000Z",
        "checkedAt": "2026-10-29T16:55:24.807Z"
      },
      {
        "id": "E6",
        "kind": "body",
        "text": "On Terminal-Bench 4.0, Mistral Large 4 improved by 13 percentage points to 41% compared to its public preview, taking the lead among open-weight models while reducing output tokens by 30%.",
        "sourceUrl": "https://mistral.ai/news/mistral-large-4-oss/",
        "source": "Mistral AI",
        "publishedAt": "2026-10-29T12:00:07.000Z",
        "checkedAt": "2026-10-29T16:55:24.807Z"
      },
      {
        "id": "E7",
        "kind": "body",
        "text": "Since its preview, we've been working with leading cybersecurity vendors to evaluate Mistral Large 4 in real-world environments to test Mistral Large 4’s strengths in vulnerability reproduction and patching.",
        "sourceUrl": "https://mistral.ai/news/mistral-large-4-oss/",
        "source": "Mistral AI",
        "publishedAt": "2026-10-29T12:00:07.000Z",
        "checkedAt": "2026-10-29T16:55:24.807Z"
      },
      {
        "id": "E8",
        "kind": "body",
        "text": "Mistral's ML4 lets defenders audit the architecture, deploy on their own infrastructure, and keep full sovereignty.",
        "sourceUrl": "https://mistral.ai/news/mistral-large-4-oss/",
        "source": "Mistral AI",
        "publishedAt": "2026-10-29T12:00:07.000Z",
        "checkedAt": "2026-10-29T16:55:24.807Z"
      },
      {
        "id": "E9",
        "kind": "body",
        "text": "Our work with Mistral Large 4 tests how well frontier AI can reason through complex vulnerabilities, accelerate remediation, and ensure defenders move faster than adversaries.",
        "sourceUrl": "https://mistral.ai/news/mistral-large-4-oss/",
        "source": "Mistral AI",
        "publishedAt": "2026-10-29T12:00:07.000Z",
        "checkedAt": "2026-10-29T16:55:24.807Z"
      },
      {
        "id": "E10",
        "kind": "body",
        "text": "We are also providing enterprise design partners such as Orange Cyberdefense, with preview access to a specialized variant of Mistral Large 4 optimized for advanced cybersecurity workflows, including penetration testing, vulnerability assessment, and red-teaming.",
        "sourceUrl": "https://mistral.ai/news/mistral-large-4-oss/",
        "source": "Mistral AI",
        "publishedAt": "2026-10-29T12:00:07.000Z",
        "checkedAt": "2026-10-29T16:55:24.807Z"
      },
      {
        "id": "E11",
        "kind": "body",
        "text": "Developments such as Mistral Large 4 demonstrate how sovereign and open-weight AI models can expand the range of trusted solutions available to European organizations.",
        "sourceUrl": "https://mistral.ai/news/mistral-large-4-oss/",
        "source": "Mistral AI",
        "publishedAt": "2026-10-29T12:00:07.000Z",
